    "page_start": 78,
    "page_end": 78,
    "notes": "Typed 'track', not 'continuation', 'domain' or 'subsidiary': it is a separate timeline for the subset of main-study patients on the extended visit cycle, with its own column structure (three 'Subsequent Cycles' columns distinguished by a 'Location' row: In Clinic / Site Staff Telephone Contact to Patient / Patient Visit to Local Clinic or In-Home Nursing) that does not appear in Table 7, and it repeats the full activity set rather than giving finer timing for a subset. Leading label columns L=1, so the first data column is position 2 and the table has 5 data columns (2-6). Footnote markers 4 to 15 are cited in the grid but their definitions are not printed in the extracted source — document page 78 prints footnotes 1 to 3 only. Cell boundaries recovered from 200-dpi raster rule-line detection (§1d); text from the pdftotext -bbox text layer."
  },
